      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1650,
      "width": 1072.21923828125,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "Method Request is a configuration aspect of Method, not a standalone AWS resource.\nMethod owns both client-facing settings and backend integration settings. Ownership is NOT a bypass route.\nSee the separate request-flow diagram for execution. Responses and canary releases are omitted.",
